    fields:  # c191
      severity: "medium"  # c191
      statement: "Nine edge.meta fields carry exactly one value across all populated rows: channel_kind='queue' (103), detection_pattern='table_name' (17), table_name='users' (17), disambiguation_fallback=True (11), dest_access_mode='read' (113), protocol='ws' (12), bridge_kind='ffi' (10), client_framework='native_websocket' (12), url_path='/ws' (12). Each field exists in the schema as if categorizing or routing, but stores a constant. Either intended for future expansion or vestigial."  # c191
      root_cause: "Schema includes optional decoration fields populated by linkers (websocket-linker, message-queue-linker, database-query-linker, dependency-linker). Each linker writes a constant value because it only emits one mechanism. Either the field should be derived from origin/edge.type, or other-value cases need linker support."  # c191
